Gets users that are in the given office at the week containing the given date. If the user is not in the results, it means it's not in the office at the given week. It returns a map of user IDs with their working location data *at each day* of the given week. Examples:
- "user1@example.com" is in the office on 2024-08-12 and remote on 2024-08-13: {"user_27e51897-53e7-4e98-84e1-d01e7cd18e4f":{"2024-08-12":{"location":"office","user_email":"user1@example.com"},"2024-08-13":{"location":"remote","user_email":"user1@example.com"}}}
