Gets the reservations (desk, room and parking bookings) and working locations of one or more users for a week. Use it for "my reservations", "my bookings", "what have I booked", "when am I in the office" and "where are my colleagues this week". Gets users working locations by email addresses at the week containing the given date. It returns a map of user IDs with their working location data for the given week. This tool should also be used to know if users have reservations at the given week. Examples:
- "user1@example.com" is in the office on 2024-08-12 and remote on 2024-08-13: {"user_27e51897-53e7-4e98-84e1-d01e7cd18e4f":{"2024-08-12":{"location":"office","user_email":"user1@example.com"},"2024-08-13":{"location":"remote","user_email":"user1@example.com"}}}
